  ],
  "comments": [
    {
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "comment": "Autoclave Basal medium supplemented with Trace element solution SL--10 and Selenite--tungstate solution under 100% N2 gas. Separately autoclave sucrose andyeast extract, and add to the medium. Filter--sterilize Vitamin solution and NaHCO3 solution, and add to the medium. Distribute the medium into culture vessels under 100% N2 gas and seal with butyl rubber stoppers. Before inoculation, reduce the medium with 5% Na2S・9H2O solution (autoclaved under N2 gas). Readjust pH to 7.7 -- 7.9, if necessary."
    }
  ]
}